  "notes": "<p class='main-notes'><b>Notes</b></p><ol class='main-list'><li>For additional information on any of the modules, refer to the <a target='_blank' href='course/en/documents/Course Learner Guide.pdf'>Course Learner Guide</a>. Check out the additional reading material in the References document and browse through the Glossary to look up definitions. All these documents are available in the section of the course.</li><li>All defined terms used throughout the course will be highlighted in blue. If you need to clarify the meaning of a term, just hover the cursor over the blue highlighted term in a desktop view or tap it in a mobile view.</li><li>Please ensure you select all interactivities and view the content. The assessment will only be unlocked if you do this.</li><li>To further develop your learning journey please contact the Global Aspen Learning Academy for extra learning material.<br><a target='_blank' href='mailto:kirlearningacademy@ie.aspenpharma.com'>kirlearningacademy@ie.aspenpharma.com</a></li><li>The course will be considered passed only if you successfully complete the assessment of all modules.</li></ol>",
